            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thank you for the push to finally fix some issues which I have been noticing earlier. They didn't bother me too much, so didn't look into them more.\r\n\r\nBoth `cursor` and `scroll` animations didn't really work with tabs because they used byte-based columns instead of virtual columns. Both of them should now be fixed in `main` branch.",
